# Projects

Project briefs for **__COURSE_CODE__** live here when the course has a longer piece of work, such as a midterm studio or a final package.

**Grading criteria and weights: __LMS__ only.** Hand-in is on **__LMS__** unless
the course README says otherwise.

## How this folder is organized

```text
docs/projects/
  README.md
  project-01.md
```

`project-NN.md` uses a zero-padded number.

## How a project brief is organized

- The question the project asks
- What you produce
- Public data used (`data/public/`)
- How the work connects to the modules (`docs/modules/module-NN.md`)

## What belongs somewhere else

Weekly labs and homework go in [`assignments/`](../../assignments/). Meeting plans go in [`docs/modules/`](../modules/). Weights stay on **__LMS__**.

## Add the next project

Create `docs/projects/project-NN.md` with the sections above.
